<section class="nova-certs" aria-labelledby="NovaCertsTitle-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="nova-certs__hero">
    <img src="{{ 'nova-certifications-hero-v1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A quality technician inspecting a precision medical component" width="1792" height="1024" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="nova-certs__hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="page-width nova-certs__hero-copy">
      <span class="nova-kicker">Documented quality</span>
      <h1 id="NovaCertsTitle-{{ section.id }}">Quality Assurance Certifications</h1>
      <p>Clear regulatory and quality-system references help dental professionals verify the NOVA system before ordering.</p>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K150363" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify FDA record</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-width nova-certs__body">
    <section class="nova-certs__intro">
      <div><span class="nova-kicker">Ensuring quality, every step of the way</span><h2>Built around documented controls.</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>NOVA Implants is committed to medical-device quality management and transparent product documentation. Our materials identify the U.S. clearance record, certified quality system and conformity information applicable to the NOVA portfolio.</p>
        <p>Regulatory status can differ by product and market. Always confirm the current label, catalog number and Instructions for Use for the exact component selected.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nova-certs__credentials" aria-labelledby="NovaCredentials-{{ section.id }}">
      <header>
        <span class="nova-kicker">Verified credentials</span>
        <h2 id="NovaCredentials-{{ section.id }}">Documentation you can review.</h2>
        <p>Direct access to NOVA’s U.S. clearance record, certified quality-management documentation and product-conformity support.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="nova-certs__grid" aria-label="NOVA quality and regulatory documentation">
        <article>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-head">
            <span class="nova-certs__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><path d="M32 5 52 13v15c0 14-8.2 25.4-20 31C20.2 53.4 12 42 12 28V13L32 5Z"/><path d="m22 32 7 7 14-16"/></svg></span>
            <span class="nova-certs__status">Official record</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-copy"><span>United States</span><h3>K150363</h3><p>FDA premarket notification for the NOVA Dental Implants System.</p><a href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K150363" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify on FDA.gov <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-head">
            <span class="nova-certs__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><circle cx="32" cy="27" r="18"/><path d="m23 27 6 6 12-13M23 43l-3 16 12-7 12 7-3-16"/></svg></span>
            <span class="nova-certs__status">Valid to 2027</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-copy"><span>Quality management</span><h3>Registration IL-99180</h3><p>Certified medical-device quality-management system, valid through August 21, 2027.</p><a href="{{ 'nova-iso-13485-certificate.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open original certificate <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-head">
            <span class="nova-certs__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="25"/><path d="M7 32h50M32 7c8 7 12 15.3 12 25S40 50 32 57c-8-7-12-15.3-12-25S24 14 32 7Z"/><path d="m25 32 5 5 10-11"/></svg></span>
            <span class="nova-certs__status nova-certs__status--support">Product specific</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nova-certs__card-copy"><span>European conformity</span><h3>CE-marked product lines</h3><p>Applicability varies by product. NOVA support can provide current conformity documentation for the item selected.</p><a href="/pages/contact">Request documentation <i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nova-certs__document" aria-labelledby="NovaIsoDocument-{{ section.id }}">
      <a class="nova-certs__document-preview" href="{{ 'nova-iso-13485-certificate.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open NOVA ISO 13485 certificate PDF">
        <img src="{{ 'nova-iso-13485-certificate-preview.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Preview of NOVA Implants ISO 13485:2016 certificate issued by the Standards Institution of Israel" width="1241" height="1754" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <div class="nova-certs__document-copy">
        <span class="nova-kicker">Original certificate</span>
        <h2 id="NovaIsoDocument-{{ section.id }}">ISO 13485:2016 documentation</h2>
        <p>The Standards Institution of Israel issued this IQNET-recognized certificate to NOVA Implants Ltd. for the manufacture and marketing of dental implants, abutments and accessories.</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Registration</dt><dd>IL-99180</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Issued</dt><dd>September 16, 2024</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Valid through</dt><dd>August 21, 2027</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ 'nova-iso-13485-certificate.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open certificate PDF</a>
        <small>This is the original document supplied by NOVA. The certificate itself remains the authoritative record.</small>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nova-certs__inspection">
      <figure><img src="{{ 'nova-certifications-inspection-v1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Documented dimensional inspection in a medical-device quality laboratory" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"></figure>
      <div>
        <span class="nova-kicker">Quality and traceability</span>
        <h2>Precision supported by process.</h2>
        <p>Documented inspection, controlled manufacturing processes and traceable product references support consistent identification throughout the professional workflow.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Documented inspection</strong><span>Quality checks support controlled production and release processes.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Clear references</strong><span>Catalog numbers and product labeling help identify the intended component.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Professional documentation</strong><span>Current labeling and Instructions for Use remain the authority for product selection and use.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="nova-certs__notice" aria-labelledby="NovaRegulatoryNotice-{{ section.id }}">
      <span class="nova-certs__notice-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><path d="M32 6 54 14v16c0 14.5-8.8 24.6-22 29C18.8 54.6 10 44.5 10 30V14L32 6Z"/><path d="M32 20v15M32 44h.01"/></svg></span>
      <div>
        <span class="nova-kicker">Before ordering</span>
        <h2 id="NovaRegulatoryNotice-{{ section.id }}">Confirm the exact product documentation.</h2>
        <p>FDA clearance K150363 applies to the NOVA Dental Implants System covered by that record; it does not represent FDA approval of every NOVA product. CE applicability also varies by product line. Always verify the current label, Instructions for Use and regulatory documentation for the specific item before ordering or clinical use.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/pages/contact">Ask NOVA support <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

